#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2236
msgid "Pie Plots"
msgstr "Cirkeldiagram"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2240
msgid ""
"Pie plots present the numeric values from a single series of categorical "
"data as slices of a circular area, the angular arc of each slice determined "
"by the proportional magnitude of each value compared to the overall sum of "
"all the values. For example, if the series had values { 1.12, 4.48, 3.36, "
"1.68, 0.56}, the contribution of each slice to the total would be {0.10, "
"0.40, 0.330, 0.15, 0.0 5}, since <literal>0.10= "
"1.12/(1.12+4.48+3.36+1.68+0.56)</literal>, and the angular arcs of the "
"wedges would be {36, 144, 108, 54, 18} degrees, since "
"<literal>36=0.10*360</literal>."
msgstr ""
"Cirkeldiagram visar de numeriska värdena i en enda dataserie som sektorer i "
"en cirkel. Varje sektors vinkel motsvarar dess värde som andel av summan av "
"alla värden. Om serien till exempel innehåller värdena { 1.12, 4.48, 3.36, "
"1.68, 0.56}, blir sektorernas andelar av summan {0.10, 0.40, 0.330, 0.15, "
"0.0 5}, eftersom <literal>0.10= 1.12/(1.12+4.48+3.36+1.68+0.56)</literal>. "
"Sektorernas vinklar blir då {36, 144, 108, 54, 18} grader, eftersom "
"<literal>36=0.10*360</literal>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2254
msgid "Pie plots do not have any sub-types."
msgstr "Cirkeldiagram har inga undertyper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2258
msgid ""
"Pie plot styles provide two choices for the rendering of the pie chart, "
"either with all slices linked into one overall circle, or with gaps between "
"the slices. The size of the gap is a property of the pie plot which can be "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Cirkeldiagram har två stilar: sektorerna kan bilda en sammanhängande cirkel "
"eller skiljas åt av mellanrum. Mellanrummets storlek kan ändras i "
"diagrammets egenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2266
msgid "An example of a pie plot"
msgstr "Exempel på cirkeldiagram"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2274
msgid ""
"A screenshot of a worksheet area showing a data table and a pie plot made "
"with those data."
msgstr ""
"Skärmbild av ett kalkylblad med en datatabell och ett cirkeldiagram som "
"bygger på värdena."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2281
msgid ""
"This screenshot shows a table of data and a pie plot. The data consist of a "
"single data series organized in a row and starting with the word "
"\"Widgets\". The series has values in five categories. The legend includes "
"the names of the different data categories."
msgstr ""
"Skärmbilden visar en datatabell och ett cirkeldiagram. Data består av en "
"dataserie i en rad som börjar med ordet ”Widgets”. Serien innehåller värden "
"för fem kategorier. Förklaringen visar kategoriernas namn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2294
msgid ""
"Each pie plot contains a single series which can include three elements "
"although only the value element is necessary. The series can have a 'Name' "
"element, which is a single text entry used to identify the series, must have"
" a 'Values' element, which is a sequence of numeric values, and may have a "
"'Label' element, which is a sequence of text entries used to identify the "
"categories. All of these elements can be defined as references to a region "
"of the worksheet, as literally defined entries, or as formula expressions "
"which result in the correct type. The legend added to a pie plot identifies "
"the different categories using the entries in the 'Label' element."
msgstr ""
"Varje cirkeldiagram innehåller en enda serie, som kan ha tre komponenter men"
" måste ha en värdekomponent. Serien kan ha komponenten ”Namn”, ett textvärde"
" som identifierar serien. Den måste ha komponenten ”Värden”, en följd av "
"numeriska värden, och kan även ha komponenten ”Etikett”, en följd av "
"textvärden som identifierar kategorierna. Komponenterna kan anges som "
"referenser till ett cellområde i kalkylbladet, som fasta värden eller som "
"formeluttryck som ger rätt datatyp. Förklaringen i cirkeldiagrammet visar "
"kategoriernas namn från komponenten ”Etikett”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2308
msgid "The data in each pie plot series"
msgstr "Data i varje serie i ett cirkeldiagram"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2331
msgid ""
"A list of textual entries labeling the category of each value. Generally, "
"this series will have as many entries as there were in the 'Value' list. "
"These will be used in the legend which may be displayed with the pie plot."
msgstr ""
"En lista med textetiketter för varje värdes kategori. Listan innehåller "
"vanligen lika många poster som listan ”Värden”. Etiketterna kan visas i "
"cirkeldiagrammets förklaring."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2341
msgid ""
"Pie plots do not have any sub-types but provide two icons to distinguish the"
" style of the plot allowing a choice between pie plots which comprise a "
"single circular area or plots with distinct pie slices separated by small "
"gaps."
msgstr ""
"Cirkeldiagram har inga undertyper, men två ikoner skiljer stilarna åt: en "
"sammanhängande cirkel eller sektorer med små mellanrum."

